														<value>"This example shows you how to use the EasyUserManager VIs directly from Teststand.

For this example to work properly, you need to add 
&lt;LabVIEW&gt;\vi.lib\Hasbun Wood Engineering\Easy User Manager 
to the search directories.

Use the local variable Local.SaveUsersFile to control whether changes are immediately 
saved to your users file. If this variable is False, you will see changes in your user
 manager denoted by a *, and you can save them manually. 
If this variable is True, changes will be immediately saved and you will not see the *.
"</value>
